	(text "A0 RADIO CAPTURE — fully wired radio shared with Sora.\nHost ESP32-S3, USB-C supply and SCD40 are outside this power/radio capture and are not yet drawn.\nHost must supply regulated3.3V (>=200mA radio allocation) and the named SPI/control signals.\nContinuous receive on Hashi; same SX1262/TCXO/RF-switch configuration as Sora.\nSee hardware/specs/power-radio.md for module-revision checks and bring-up requirements."
